# QA proof artifacts are intentional (override global *.log).
# Blanket un-ignore so every new results_* campaign under the bench tree is
# tracked without editing .gitignore again.
!qa/live/
!qa/live/**/*.log
!qa/bench-swebench-5x5/
!qa/bench-swebench-5x5/**
!qa/bench-swebench-5x5/**/*.log

# Flight-recorder JSONL can be hundreds of MB; keep on disk next to results, not in git.
*.trace.jsonl
